  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 0.10.0\n* Added .NET 10 TFM ( #80 )\n* Updated DotExtensions dependency from 9.0.0 Preview 2 to 9.0.0 Preview 3\n* Moved ``CustomEnumeratorEnumerable`` class back into EnhancedLinq and removed dependency on DotPrimitives.Collections\n* Removed dependency on ``System.Linq.AsyncEnumerable`` for .NET 10 TFM (since it is not needed starting with .NET 10 and newer) - It is still required for .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 8, and .NET 9 TFMs",
